RD-06(c) conduct referral. No gantry or surcharge line is unmatched, so no POL-RD-09(4) billing-integrity referral. A traffic advisory is absent from the bundle (EV-ADVIS-00525-01, MISSING, weight 0.0), but neither party asserted a traffic cause, so POL-RD-13 does not engage and this does not escalate. The deciding facts are carried by the fare record at weight 1.0, and confidence is 0.95, above the 0.70 floor.",
